                                "sense_id": "96dedfc1-3f52-37c2-8014-06efd8bc1877",
                                "text": "He was delighted to come across a little-worn crest of the old Great Eastern Railway, never dreaming that such a relic would still be in use, and was taking a pencil-rubbing to add to his collection."
